      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... there is no \"self\" waiting to breathe again. that's just what i tell myself to get through the day, but it feels like a lie. it's like the house was demolished and i'm just standing in the empty lot. it's not even sad anymore, it's just... hollow. i feel like i'm just taking up space that doesn't belong to me. like i'm just a shadow that forgot to disappear.",
